rver Setup Complete\n\nYour Git server is now fully operational with all requested features:\n\n### **Core Services**\n- **SSH Server**: Running on port 22 with password authentication (git/password)\n- **Nginx HTTPS**: Running on port 8443 with self-signed certificate\n- **Git Repository**: Bare repository at `/git/project`\n\n### **SSH Access**\n```bash\ngit clone ssh://git@localhost/git/project\n# Username: git\n# Password: password\n```\n\n### **HTTPS Endpoints**\n- **Main branch**: https://localhost:8443/index.html\n- **Dev branch**: https://localhost:8443/dev/index.html\n- **Certificate**: Self-signed at `/etc/nginx/certs/cert.pem`\n\n### **Automated Deployment**\n- **Post-receive Hook**: `/git/project/hooks/post-receive`\n- **Main deployment directory**: `/var/www/main/`\n- **Dev deployment directory**: `/var/www/dev/`\n- **Deployment speed**: ~65ms (well under 3-second limit ✓)\n\n### **Configuration Files**\n- **SSH Config**: `/etc/ssh/sshd_config` - Password authentication enabled\n- **Nginx Config**: `/etc/nginx/sites-available/default` - Serves both branches\n- **Git Config**: `/git/project/config` - Bare repository with post-receive hooks\n\n### **Current Status**\n- ✓ SSH server accepting password authentication\n- ✓ Nginx serving HTTPS with self-signed certificate\n- ✓ Both main and dev branches deployed and accessible\n- ✓ Post-receive hook automatically deploys on push\n- ✓ Deployment completes in < 100ms (target: < 3000ms)\n\nThe system is ready to use. When you push to either the main or dev branch, the post-receive hook will automatically update the corresponding `/var/www/` directory, which Nginx serves over HTTPS.","ttft_ms":2732,"type":"result","duration_ms":112886,"uuid":"dede6ef9-bb77-478c-af91-90ce546b7885","ttft_stream_ms":801,"time_to_request_ms":83,"queued_turn_count":0}
